{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_208_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_208","textTraditional":"一、二十有八年。春王三月，葬曹悼公。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_208_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_208","textTraditional":"二、公如晉，次于乾侯。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_208_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_208","textTraditional":"三、夏四月丙戌，鄭伯寗卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_208_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_208","textTraditional":"四、六月，葬鄭定公。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_208_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_208","textTraditional":"五、秋七月癸巳，滕子寗卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_208_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_208","textTraditional":"六、冬，葬滕悼公。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}